{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1795026934286293631,"compiled_state":{"alias":"illtimed-sharpcut-ray","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"af641c746de9e1a65f8e1e9be41922915d4e0d31d8150b944bbf64ae3a9418df","event_uuid":"6f753f66-8dae-4383-b2c3-592985428986","position":{"commit_sha":"dcd620c0a8d40cae6acc8f0e0cfe38a597492b7d","position":"1795026815013180036-6f753f66-8dae-4383-b2c3-592985428986"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"f83f3e8a1f3c68e1017c9fac90a292c43deacd40ed568223736984c60af4d376","event_uuid":"3745ae90-9d90-4812-a354-d2772f36ce50","position":{"commit_sha":"208c283a325d38f350e4996cc27a7b5bbcefdc78","position":"1795026934286293630-3745ae90-9d90-4812-a354-d2772f36ce50"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1795026815013180036,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"3745ae90-9d90-4812-a354-d2772f36ce50","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"e266-c398-f5cd-4a3c"}],"description":"## Observation\nIn an isolated scratch store (2026-11-18 PST), `rebar.llm.verify_completion(\"cushiony-feathered-anura\", source=\"local\")` failed at the provider (403, dummy AWS credentials). The failure path wrote a `COMPLETION_VERDICT` event with `schema: gate_error_v1` into a NEW directory `.tickets-tracker/cushiony-feathered-anura/` instead of the ticket's canonical directory `7689-bdbe-e709-49ef/`, and committed it. Every later `verify_completion` call by alias then failed with `rebar show failed (exit 1): ticket \"cushiony-feathered-anura\" has no CREATE or SNAPSHOT event`, because the alias now resolved to the stray directory.\n\n`emit_gate_error` (src/rebar/llm/gate_error_sidecar.py) passes the caller's `ticket_id` straight to `append_event` without resolving it to the canonical id. Callers: src/rebar/llm/workflow/gate_dispatch.py (5 sites) and src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_failures.py.\n\n`origin/tickets` currently has no alias-named directories (checked 2026-11-18), so the production MCP path has not hit this yet; the path that has is a library call with an alias.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A regression test calls a failing gate run with an alias and asserts the gate_error sidecar lands in the canonical ticket directory and no alias-named directory is created.\n- [ ] The gate_error sidecar emitter resolves the ticket id to its canonical directory before appending.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["llm"],"ticket_id":"9325-1186-f822-4594","ticket_type":"bug","title":"A failed gate run called with an alias writes its gate_error sidecar into a new alias-named ticket directory","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6f753f66-8dae-4383-b2c3-592985428986","3745ae90-9d90-4812-a354-d2772f36ce50"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795026934286293631,"uuid":"a94f493a-abda-4521-9595-e9059d8a281d"}
